<title>SINGAPORE: Chemical Industries liquidates unit.</title>
<headline>Chemical Industries liquidates unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical Industries (Far East) Ltd said in a statement on Tuesday that it had put its subsidiary company Chemair Investment Pte Ltd into voluntary liquidation.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
